<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{{subject}}</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f5f5f5; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    .header { background: #7c3aed; padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
    .body { padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; }
    .body p { color: #4b5563; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 24px; }
    .code-box { display: inline-block; background: #f3f0ff; border: 2px solid #7c3aed; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 40px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .code { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #7c3aed; }
    .note { color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; margin: 0; }
    .footer { background: #f9fafb; padding: 16px 24px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }
    .footer p { margin: 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 11px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>MiTienda</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Tu código de verificación es:</p>
      <div class="code-box">
        <div class="code">{{code}}</div>
      </div>
      <p class="note">Este código vence en <strong>10 minutos</strong>.<br />Si no solicitaste este código, ignora este correo.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} MiTienda. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
